{"game": "arc-raiders", "language": "english", "appid": 1808500, "month": "2026-03", "window": 3, "start_date": 1773619200, "end_date": 1774310399, "month_true_total": 12918, "quota": 19, "returned": 19, "pulled_at": "2026-09-10 21:18:46 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "221534402", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006220342", "personaname": "Madrox", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198006220342/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 44116, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 2989, "playtime_at_review": 40048, "deck_playtime_at_review": 4, "last_played": 1789096366, "avatar": "27f83c7368f938cb222dbc1a94313285a60fd1d9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Every round has brand new accounts with the best gear and perfect awareness and Embark is like \"we're doing everything we can to mitigate cheating.\" Everything except trying maybe. Maybe the people with game bans on their profiles aren't trustworthy. Maybe the 6 people running around in the same exact outfit that aren't shooting each other might be up to something. Maybe even the slightest effort is just a bit too much to ask of Embark.\n\nGame is literally overrun with cheaters wall-hacking. The way the cheat works they can run it on a separate computer and make it undetectable by the game's anti-cheat. Because of Embark's completely inability (or even willingness?) to do anything about it, the game has been hemorrhaging players and the cheating is even more pronounced. Fun game completely ruined by cheaters that's no longer worth buying.\n\nI felt the need to update this review because they made it harder to report people. You used to be able to do it on the post-game map so it was easier to identify the person in question. I guess they got tired of so many reports so they removed this ability and you have to now remember to check names then look through the social menu for recently played with to report someone. God forbid they take action for bad behavior. They would rather shut down the complaining about it.\n\nI don't know why I thought Embark could make a game where cheating wasn't rampant. I don't know how many aimbots there are, but there are an insane amount of wallhackers. Just like The Finals, Embark refuses to do anything about it as long as people still buy their overpriced cosmetics.\n\nStay away from any and all Embark games.", "timestamp_created": 1774310337, "timestamp_updated": 1786833749, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "221534373", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972313246", "personaname": "stevenj0hn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/stevenj0hn/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 7534, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6784, "deck_playtime_at_review": 34, "last_played": 1776289400, "avatar": "2ee9be3846fe4c68c930a927c775e304856ce74a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Excellent fun. Gave me permanent trust issues.", "timestamp_created": 1774310315, "timestamp_updated": 1774310315, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "221533918", "author": {"steamid": "76561199059809568", "personaname": "Quality of John", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199059809568/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 16458, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 16440, "last_played": 1783192108, "avatar": "fcce7421404f6c4b16494020a1b96f0ac5ed4943"}, "language": "english", "review": "Do you have trust issues of people walking up to you and talking to you? \nYou will now after playing this. It has almost given me trauma when I see confrontation approaching. \n\nPeople are mean in the world and mean people need to play with other mean people and leave the peaceful players alone. It'd be cooler if I could turn off the receiving damage from players even if it came with a debuff of 10% less loot gathered.", "timestamp_created": 1774309843, "timestamp_updated": 1780424667, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "221533753", "author": {"steamid": "76561199630411598", "personaname": "lizzykitten9", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199630411598/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 31322, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 25511, "last_played": 1787842819, "avatar": "cce39e321416c5f005e094c01f74dc06e78dcb4d"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game", "timestamp_created": 1774309664, "timestamp_updated": 1774309664, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "221533656", "author": {"steamid": "76561199089879710", "personaname": "Em", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199089879710/", "num_games_owned": 47, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2