rally run this game already accounts for this game range from 50 cents to 4 dollars due to steam share and other methods so these cheaters have an abundant amount of accounts i play oce and I use to pvp a fair bit so the lobbies i get are fairly aggressive in duos and I'm getting killed but cheaters constantly half of them don't even try to hide it I get that many refunds it's just a given. The cheaters aren't even doing it for money or loot as there's been that many mass dupes the games economy is in the ground first there's embark some how manage to leave their public apis unprotected so any skid with fiddler could literally just send a single post man and mass dupe loot I've seen people with 10k+ temp 4s these so there's basically no fairplay there's still existing dupes in the game that embark hasn't seem to of addressed this is a great game with horrible execution from a useless studio it seems.", "timestamp_created": 1774306246, "timestamp_updated": 1774306246, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "221530111", "author": {"steamid": "76561198863419063", "personaname": "grlogan5", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198863419063/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1695, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 957, "last_played": 1777171877, "avatar": "8442685651231b08503c282a75c5f324df2ae085"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is just super fun and a great game to play with friends. 10/10 would recommend.", "timestamp_created": 1774306026, "timestamp_updated": 1774306026, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, 